  residual kind membrane, model DSPM-DE) fitted the values marked FITTED
  below to the datasets named in fit {}; every other value is base record
  NF270_dspmde's.  Fitted values are rounded to 6 significant figures,
  and the verdict was taken at the rounded values.

  A Process-mode run checks the fingerprints in fit {} before it uses this
  record and REFUSES it, naming what changed, when a dataset, the fit block
  or the base record has moved since: re-run the case in Properties mode
